{"id":100890,"vol":{"id":796,"name":"Batman"},"num":"635","name":"Under the Hood, Part 1: New Business","title":"Batman #635","year":"2005","date":"2005-02-01","store":"2004-12-29","poster":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_medium/0/4/67892-796-100890-1-batman.jpg","big":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_large/0/4/67892-796-100890-1-batman.jpg","pub":"DC Comics","deck":"","desc":"Batman learns that someone unknown has managed a hostile takeover of Kord industries, which is WayneTech's research and development unit, responsible for a number of the items he uses in his war on crime. Meanwhile, as Black Mask continues to increase his grip on Gotham's underworld, a new player makes himself known. The Red Hood, who insists that his drug dealer stay away from kids. In response, Black Mask recruits yet another of Gotham's supercriminals - Mister Freeze.","people":[{"id":9587,"name":"Alex Sinclair","role":"colorist"},{"id":41760,"name":"Bob Schreck","role":"editor"},{"id":51584,"name":"Dan DiDio","role":"editor"},{"id":1533,"name":"Doug Mahnke","role":"penciler"},{"id":10383,"name":"Judd Winick","role":"writer"},{"id":8310,"name":"Matt Wagner","role":"cover"},{"id":46967,"name":"Michael Wright","role":"editor"},{"id":41785,"name":"Pat Brosseau","role":"letterer"},{"id":6197,"name":"Tom Nguyen","role":"inker"}],"chars":[{"id":1699,"name":"Batman","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/11144/111442876/8759934-jrjrhr.jpg"},{"id":5556,"name":"Alfred Pennyworth","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/12/124259/8057339-e2lokwbxsaazhqn.jpg"},{"id":5368,"name":"Barbara Gordon","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/1/15776/10071325-barbara_gordon.jpg"}],"arcs":[{"id":56274,"name":"\"Batman\" Under the Hood"}]}